资源包已适配2倍界面缩放设置（未来可能支持1倍和3倍缩放）。</li>\n</ul><h3>⭐ 最佳体验</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgui-simplestylized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_923720d30a924f2bb797da965271b01c~mv2.png\" alt=\"与此资源包搭配使用获得最佳体验！\"></a></p><h2>指南/预览</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mC2IML84/images/3f46f9251afd53c389f3f2beff86cb25462308c3.gif\" alt=\"预览GIF\"></p><p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_ef06494637f14cfabe66d6b697c1b0ae~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"预览\"></p><h2>✨ 合作伙伴</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.rocketnode.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_568565d2774047e188ebd98b83ef588c~mv2.png\" alt=\"合作伙伴RocketNode横幅 - GabrielDja\"></a></p>",
